<title>USA: Collective sets date for vote on merger.</title>
<headline>Collective sets date for vote on merger.</headline>
<dateline>EGG HARBOR, N.J. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collective Bancorp Inc said Tuesday it will hold a special meeting of stockholders July 16, to vote on its merger with Summit Bancorp. Stockholders of record as of May 30, will be entitled to to vote at the meeting.</p>
<p>The deal, in which Collective will be subsumed into Summit, was valued at $867 million when it was announced in February.</p>
